                                        <span><strong>Shared</strong> — data co-located with other tenants. <strong>Dedicated</strong> — isolated database and storage. Moving regions may require a data migration.</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="tot-empty-hint">
                                        <i class="bi bi-diagram-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
